    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This shape will cause the spell (or spell staff/book) to coalesce into a bound sword.\n\nThe components will be applied to whatever mob I hit with it. The sword has a "
        },
        {
          "text": "constant minor mana drain, unless I am wearing a ",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "Battlemage Amulet",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and consumes a "
        },
        {
          "text": "burst of mana with each hit",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nTo return the sword to a spell, drop it on the ground. It will also revert automatically if I run out of mana."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
